flowchart TD
    subgraph Sources["Source Repositories"]
        SPI[science-platform-images]
        NBR[notebooks-repo<br/>notebooks, per-notebook requirements.txt,<br/>refdata_dependencies.yaml]
    end

    subgraph Local["Local Curator Workflow — never pushed to GHCR"]
        USER((User))
        SPEC[wrangler spec]
        WRANGLER[nb-wrangler<br/>resolves package constraints]
        LDOCKER[Docker build - local]
        LTEST[local end-to-end image test<br/>verifies spec & image correctness]
    end

    subgraph Actions["GitHub Actions"]
        IMG_REPO[(nb-wrangler-images<br/>on GitHub)]
        CURATION[Curation Action<br/>runs nb-wrangler to generate<br/>code + data locks before build]
        REINSTALL[Reinstallation Action<br/>builds pre-locked image<br/>from unaltered spec]
        ADVISE[advisory tests on image<br/>imports & notebooks]
    end

    DOCKER[Docker build - pipeline]

    subgraph Registries["Registries & Environments"]
        GHCR[(GHCR container registry)]
        ECR[(Amazon ECR)]
        PROD[PROD]
    end

    JH[JupyterHub TEST spawner]
    TEST[Curator or pipeline<br/>tests image on platform]

    SPI -->|common image package requirements| WRANGLER
    NBR -->|notebooks, per-notebook requirements.txt,<br/>refdata_dependencies.yaml| WRANGLER

    USER -->|adds inline package, data, environment,<br/>image requirements| SPEC
    USER -.->|optional: run locally to resolve constraints<br/>& add package/data locks| WRANGLER
    WRANGLER -.->|package & data locks added locally| SPEC
    USER -.->|optional: build test image locally| LDOCKER
    LDOCKER -.->|local image for local e2e testing only| LTEST

    USER -->|adds spec & tooling| IMG_REPO
    IMG_REPO -->|tooling + spec| CURATION
    IMG_REPO -->|tooling + spec| REINSTALL
    CURATION -->|locked spec| DOCKER
    REINSTALL -->|unaltered spec| DOCKER
    DOCKER -->|"1st: Action pushes notebook/code + spec images"| GHCR
    DOCKER -->|"2nd: Action tests built image"| ADVISE

    GHCR -->|spawner discovers & pulls| JH
    JH --> TEST
    TEST -->|tested image delivered| ECR
    ECR -->|promoted| PROD
